     TPU corner pieces, press-fit onto the extrusion ends.

     2026-08 revision: rounded cosmetic redesign. The press-fit body is
     UNCHANGED at 60 x 60 x 66 mm and still sits on the extrusion at |x|=130,
     |y|=80 mm. What is new is two 12 mm fins (at z=-20..-8 and -52..-40 in CAD)
     that protrude 5 mm further out, so the envelope grows 380 x 280 ->
     390 x 290 mm. The top plate is shorter than the bumpers in X, so the
     bumpers set the footprint in both axes.

     IMPORTING A NEW EXPORT — three things bit us, in order:

       1. bumper_assembly.stl holds THREE disconnected bodies (main + 2 fins),
          not one. Treat them as one part but datum on the MAIN body, not on
          the whole-assembly bounding box, or the fins pull the datum 5 mm off.
       2. The export is the FRONT-RIGHT corner: its fins protrude +X and -Y.
          For a target quadrant (qx, qy) the mirror is (qx, -qy).
       3. The export's absolute XY is arbitrary (Z happens to be right), so
          datum the main body's inner faces to |x|=130, |y|=80 rather than
          trusting the exported position.

     Only one corner is exported; the other three are mirrors, as before.

     Collision stays a box primitive, not the mesh: the part is rounded with no
     flat faces, and a 65 mm box covering body+fins is cheap and conservative. --><link name="bumper_front_left_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.00320947 -0.00742985 -0.0302987"/><mass value="0.71387"/><inertia ixx="0.00047" ixy="8.4e-05" ixz="5.1e-05" iyy="0.000371" iyz="-3.4e-05" izz="0.000311"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.17 -0.12 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/bumper_front_left_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0075 -0.0075 -0.033"/><geometry><box size="0.065 0.065 0.066"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="bumper_front_right_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.00320947 0.00742985 -0.0302987"/><mass value="0.71387"/><inertia ixx="0.00047" ixy="-8.4e-05" ixz="5.1e-05" iyy="0.000371" iyz="3.4e-05" izz="0.000311"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.17 0.12 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/bumper_front_right_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0075 0.0075 -0.033"/><geometry><box size="0.065 0.065 0.066"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="bumper_back_left_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.00320951 -0.0074299 -0.0302986"/><mass value="0.713868"/><inertia ixx="0.00047" ixy="-8.4e-05" ixz="-5.1e-05" iyy="0.000371" iyz="-3.4e-05" izz="0.000311"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.17 -0.12 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/bumper_back_left_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0075 -0.0075 -0.033"/><geometry><box size="0.065 0.065 0.066"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="bumper_back_right_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.00320951 0.0074299 -0.0302986"/><mass value="0.713868"/><inertia ixx="0.00047" ixy="8.4e-05" ixz="-5.1e-05" iyy="0.000371" iyz="3.4e-05" izz="0.000311"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.17 0.12 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/bumper_back_right_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0075 0.0075 -0.033"/><geometry><box size="0.065 0.065 0.066"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="bumper_front_left_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.17 0.12 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="bumper_front_left_1"/></joint><joint name="bumper_front_right_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.17 -0.12 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="bumper_front_right_1"/></joint><joint name="bumper_back_left_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.17 0.12 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="bumper_back_left_1"/></joint><joint name="bumper_back_right_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.17 -0.12 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="bumper_back_right_1"/></joint><!-- ============================== payload deck ==============================
     top_plate_1 rides 45 mm of standoff above base_link. It is the mount
     point every add-on variant (arm, tower) parents to: renaming it
     or moving it ripples into those packages. --><link name="standoff_front_left_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.0225"/><mass value="0.00998792"/><inertia ixx="2e-06" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2e-06" iyz="0" izz="0"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.08 -0.11 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/standoff_front_left_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="hardware_steel"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 -8.79288e-06 0.0225"/><geometry><cylinder length="0.045" radius="0.00299561"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="standoff_front_right_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.0225"/><mass value="0.00998792"/><inertia ixx="2e-06" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2e-06" iyz="0" izz="0"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.08 0.11 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/standoff_front_right_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="hardware_steel"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 -8.79288e-06 0.0225"/><geometry><cylinder length="0.045" radius="0.00299561"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="standoff_back_left_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.0225"/><mass value="0.00998792"/><inertia ixx="2e-06" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2e-06" iyz="0" izz="0"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 -0.11 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/standoff_back_left_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="hardware_steel"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 8.79288e-06 0.0225"/><geometry><cylinder length="0.045" radius="0.00299561"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="standoff_back_right_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.0225"/><mass value="0.00998792"/><inertia ixx="2e-06" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2e-06" iyz="0" izz="0"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 0.11 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/standoff_back_right_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="hardware_steel"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 8.79288e-06 0.0225"/><geometry><cylinder length="0.045" radius="0.00299561"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="top_plate_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0799507 0.11 0.00150002"/><mass value="0.990324"/><inertia ixx="0.004737" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.002662" iyz="0" izz="0.007398"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 0.11 -0.048"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/top_plate_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plate_aluminum"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0799519 0.11 0.00150002"/><geometry><box size="0.179904 0.24 0.003"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="standoff_front_left_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 0.11 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="standoff_front_left_1"/></joint><joint name="standoff_front_right_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 -0.11 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="standoff_front_right_1"/></joint><joint name="standoff_back_left_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.08 0.11 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="standoff_back_left_1"/></joint><joint name="standoff_back_right_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.08 -0.11 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="standoff_back_right_1"/></joint><joint name="top_plate_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.045"/><parent link="standoff_back_right_1"/><child link="top_plate_1"/></joint><!-- ================================= lidar =================================
     RPLidar C1. lidar_frame is the scan origin: the rotor axis, at the
     height of the optical window between the base and the spinning cap
     (CAD z = 14.5 mm, i.e. 96.5 mm off the floor). /scan is stamped in
     it and slam/nav consume it from there. --><link name="lidar_mount_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0117249 -0.0501338 -0.0161636"/><mass value="0.20407"/><inertia ixx="0.000244" ixy="0" ixz="-2e-06" iyy="8.4e-05" iyz="0" izz="0.000322"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.1 -0.05 0"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/lidar_mount_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.01035 -0.05 -0.00945654"/><geometry><box size="0.0688 0.1095 0.0189131"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="lidar_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0214156 -0.0215945 0.0140184"/><mass value="0.253675"/><inertia ixx="0.000111" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.000111" iyz="0" izz="0.000156"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.138888 -0.0215 0.015813"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/lidar_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="motor_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0214997 -0.0215 0.0206499"/><geometry><cylinder length="0.0413" radius="0.0278"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="lidar_mount_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.1 0.05 0.081965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="lidar_mount_1"/></joint><joint name="lidar_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.038888 -0.0285 -0.015813"/><parent link="lidar_mount_1"/><child link="lidar_1"/></joint><link name="lidar_frame"/><joint name="lidar_frame_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.021498 -0.0215 0.030313"/><parent link="lidar_1"/><child link="lidar_frame"/></joint><!-- ================================= camera =================================
     One bracket, two options. camera_link is the front face of whichever
     module is fitted, +X out of the lens; camera_optical_frame is the
     REP-103 optical twist of it (z out of the lens, x right, y down).

     camera_optical_frame is what image and camera_info messages are stamped
     with — matching realsense2_camera and depthai, so the frame graph does not
     change when the real module replaces the sim one. camera_link stays the
     mount point you position in CAD. See docs/robocore-camera-frames.md. --><link name="camera_edge_bracket_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0234361 -0.05 -0.00264041"/><mass value="0.40831"/><inertia ixx="0.000606377" ixy="0" ixz="6.71514e-05" iyy="0.000544929" iyz="0" izz="0.00108709"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.16 -0.05 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/camera_edge_bracket_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.038 -0.05 -0.013"/><geometry><box size="0.104 0.12 0.034"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="camera_edge_bracket_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.16 0.05 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="camera_edge_bracket_1"/></joint><link name="camera_realsense_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0116574 0.0239083 -2.34873e-05"/><mass value="0.0720014"/><inertia ixx="4.6e-05" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="7e-06" iyz="0" izz="4.7e-05"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.174 0.0225 0.0135"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/camera_realsense_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="electronics_grey"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.012525 0.0225433 -2.15769e-08"/><geometry><box size="0.02505 0.0898433 0.025"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="camera_realsense_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.014 -0.0725 -0.0165"/><parent link="camera_edge_bracket_1"/><child link="camera_realsense_1"/></joint><link name="camera_link"/><joint name="camera_link_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.02505 0.0225 0"/><parent link="camera_realsense_1"/><child link="camera_link"/></joint><link name="camera_optical_frame"/><joint name="camera_optical_frame_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="-1.570796 0 -1.570796" xyz="0 0 0"/><parent link="camera_link"/><child link="camera_optical_frame"/></joint><!-- =========================== compute + link101 ===========================
     Orin on its printed tray at the back; the link101 carrier board on its
     own tray amidships. The IMU lives on the link101 PCB, so imu_link
     hangs off that board (centre of the board, top copper) rather than
     off base_link, so the EKF gets the real lever arm. --><link name="jetson_mount_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.00236852 0.000111413 0.00216572"/><mass value="0.228562"/><inertia ixx="0.000461977" ixy="-1.82344e-07" ixz="-1.33082e-07" iyy="0.000183569" iyz="0" izz="0.000644485"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.127 0 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/jetson_mount_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-1.52588e-08 -4.57764e-08 0.0055"/><geometry><box size="0.086 0.131455 0.011"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="orin_simplified_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.034953 0.045059 0.0100499"/><mass value="0.543842"/><inertia ixx="0.00033" ixy="-1.1e-05" ixz="-3.3e-05" iyy="0.000355" iyz="-4e-06" izz="0.00062"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.092 0.046136 -0.014"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/orin_simplified_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="electronics_grey"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0364243 0.0459998 0.013718"/><geometry><box size="0.0808486 0.1 0.032296"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="orp_link101_mount_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="3.66232e-09 -8.75664e-09 0.0022725"/><mass value="0.178021"/><inertia ixx="0.000205311" ixy="-2.40602e-08" ixz="0" iyy="0.000122439" iyz="0" izz="0.000326676"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.01 0 -0.003"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/orp_link101_mount_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="plastic_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.006"/><geometry><box size="0.08 0.1 0.012"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="link_101_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0313065 0.0440383 0.00306757"/><mass value="0.114789"/><inertia ixx="5.9e-05" ixy="-2e-06" ixz="-2e-06" iyy="4.6e-05" iyz="-2e-06" izz="0.000103"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0381 0.0415 -0.015"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/base101_description/share/base101_description/meshes/link_101_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="pcb_green"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.027775 0.0414 0.0076975"/><geometry><box size="0.06525 0.09 0.015395"/></geometry></collision></link><joint name="jetson_mount_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.127 0 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="jetson_mount_1"/></joint><joint name="orin_simplified_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.035 -0.046136 0.011"/><parent link="jetson_mount_1"/><child link="orin_simplified_1"/></joint><joint name="orp_link101_mount_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.01 0 0.084965"/><parent link="base_link"/><child link="orp_link101_mount_1"/></joint><joint name="link_101_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.0281 -0.0415 0.012"/><parent link="orp_link101_mount_1"/><child link="link_101_1"/></joint><link name="imu_link"/><joint name="imu_link_joint" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0282 0.0414 0.002"/><parent link="link_101_1"/><child link="imu_link"/></joint><!-- One mod101 arm on the chassis deck. Included from base101.xacro when
     arm:=true, and only then — this file resolves $(find mod101_description),
     so an armless workspace must never process it. mod101 stays a standalone
     repo: build it first and source its install as an underlay, then build
     this workspace.

     Joint names get the arm_ prefix (arm_joint_base ... arm_joint_wrist_roll,
     plus the tool's arm_6); controllers live in
     base101_control/config/controllers.{sim,hw}.yaml. --><!-- kg/m --><!-- The only mod101 material base101's palette doesn't already define
     (silver / accent_green / motor_black match byte-for-byte). --><material name="body_darkgrey"><color rgba="0.200 0.200 0.200 1.0"/></material><joint name="arm_base_mount" type="fixed"><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.08 0.11 0.003"/><parent link="top_plate_1"/><child link="arm_base_link"/></joint><!-- base_link is re-centred on the base plate: origin at the centre of the
     100x120 mm footprint, on the underside mounting face. The CAD export put
     it ~1.4 cm/7.3 cm/6.4 cm off in the corner and below the plate, which made
     every caller hand-tune its mount xyz. Callers can now bolt the arm down
     with the plain deck-centre / deck-top offset. --><link name="arm_base_link"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="-0.008702404 0.000111487 0.00989655"/><mass value="0.0832840557"/><inertia ixx="9.7521062e-05" ixy="3.84319456e-07" ixz="1.46041393e-05" iyy="9.08915514e-05" iyz="-2.88239592e-07" izz="0.000162086731"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.007380806 -0.073155779 -0.063973656"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/mod101_description/share/mod101_description/meshes/base_link.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="body_darkgrey"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0.0265"/><geometry><box size="0.1 0.12 0.053"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="arm_servo_base_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.018164451014978943 -0.010249127257539445 -0.015123159345860906"/><mass value="0.0658962961901927"/><inertia ixx="1e-05" ixy="0.0" ixz="-0.0" iyy="1.8e-05" iyz="0.0" izz="1.4e-05"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.033981 -0.084076 -0.113974"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/mod101_description/share/mod101_description/meshes/servo_base_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="motor_black"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0165002 -0.0102503 -0.0157003"/><geometry><box size="0.0452234 0.0247234 0.0378"/></geometry></collision></link><link name="arm_base_cover_1"><inertial><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.02230051687619229 0.01594291177721944 -3.4268786498758974e-07"/><mass value="0.0257291587"/><inertia ixx="8.20543276e-06" ixy="1.36757213e-07" ixz="-0" iyy="1.4769779e-05" iyz="0" izz="1.94195242e-05"/></inertial><visual><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.045885 -0.058276 -0.097774"/><geometry><mesh filename="file:///bpe/docker/.sim/install/mod101_description/share/mod101_description/meshes/base_cover_1.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/></geometry><material name="accent_green"/></visual><collision><origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0.0202023 0.01580